WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:19.060
Sup playa? This week we in living
color with The Giver by Lois Lowry.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:26.040
11-year old thug Jonas comin’ up in
a trap dat at first seem pretty legit. Unlike

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:31.730
the crooked outside world, or “elsewhere,”
this hood ain’t got no war, disease, hunger,

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:32.850
or poverty.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:37.800
Truth is, though, the only reason
peeps keepin’ it so chill is cuz errybody

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.930
sippin on the philosophy of “sameness,”
which basically mean two things: errybody

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:48.370
livin like a bunch of lame-ass drones to keep
sh** peaceful, and a crew of old geezers callin

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.720
all the shots: who hooks up with who, how
many babies a biddy can pop out. Sh** they

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:59.239
even makin you pop pillz dat kill a brutha’s
mojo. Ugh. And when you too old to hack it

00:00:59.239 --> 00:01:02.210
anymo, you get “released.” We’ll get
to dat later.

00:01:02.210 --> 00:01:06.040
Now dat Jonas’s finally old enough
to count the hairs on his nuts, dem old folk

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:11.470
give him the special job of “Receiver of
Memories,” cuz unlike errybody else in the

00:01:11.470 --> 00:01:15.689
streets, Jonas got “The Capacity to See
Beyond.” See back when the hood decided

00:01:15.689 --> 00:01:20.210
to start preachin dat “sameness” jive,
dem old timers took all the world’s memories

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:24.179
and dumped em in the mind of just one G: the
“Reciever.”

00:01:24.179 --> 00:01:27.950
And now the old reciever gonna get
up on his givin grind and pour da memories

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:30.409
outta his dome in to Jonas’s.

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:34.659
As da Giver packin dem memories in
to Jonas’s backside, Jonas be learnin about

00:01:34.659 --> 00:01:40.579
all sorts of crazy sh*t he ain’t never known
about- the sun, snow, love, and even war.

00:01:40.579 --> 00:01:45.109
By the time that Jonas gets a
little taste of what the Giver dealin, J-Dog

00:01:45.109 --> 00:01:50.090
realize that the memories of the world filled
with too much pain, and not even the hardest

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:56.469
hustla can handle em solo without ODing. Jonas
asks The Giver “why cant we all share this

00:01:56.469 --> 00:02:00.810
pain, yo? Lighten the load, naw mean?” If
we cut it up and share it with all the hood,

00:02:00.810 --> 00:02:06.579
we can get this sh*t on lock. But the Giver
like ain’t happenin yo. Regular homies don’t

00:02:06.579 --> 00:02:11.200
want pain. They just wanna keep things as
chill as possible. But Jonas ain’t buyin

00:02:11.200 --> 00:02:11.790
dat mess.

00:02:11.790 --> 00:02:15.290
Then one day Jonas learn that
gettin “released” is really just gettin

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:20.620
wasted by the man, and his little baby-buddy
Gabriel is next on the hit list. So he say

00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:23.329
“Man f*** this. I’m out.”

00:02:23.329 --> 00:02:28.140
Since memories last forever, Jonas gonna get
what he really wants: Cuz once he peaces outta

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:33.170
town, erryone’s gonna have to take a hit
of dem painful memories. Even though he want

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:38.120
The Giver to come, the G-man like “Nah burh.
I gotta hold it down and make sure nobody

00:02:38.120 --> 00:02:42.590
loses their sh*t when they experience pain
and loneliness for the first time.”

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:47.200
So Jonas grabs baby Gabe and rolls
out to the outside world where things be all

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:52.480
sorts of nasty! But he gotta nut up and beast
through it all to keep him and Gabe alive.

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:56.310
When the book ends, Jonas and Gabe
cruisin on a sled towards some bright lights

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:01.469
in a window. And that’s it. Da hell?

00:03:05.400 --> 00:03:08.460
First thing you gotz to know is that when
the author was a lil’ thug-ette she was

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:13.680
kickin it w peeps crazy bout keepin errybody
in line. A lotta scholars think it made old

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:17.930
Lo-Lo wanna spit some raw truth bout what
it’s like livin in a spot where somebody

00:03:17.930 --> 00:03:20.600
ridin yo nuts 24/7.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:24.920
Having somebody bust yo ass til it's
raw is gonna do you just like Jonas’s boy

00:03:24.920 --> 00:03:28.400
Asher got did when he wasn’t talkin right.

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:49.420
In a world where the law gets all
up in your shit erry time you bone- up,

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:52.520
sometimes better to just throw up the deuce
to all dem haters.

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:57.040
But at the beginning of the book, Lowry makin
it seem like Jonas’s hood is the place to be.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:04:02.150
Fo example, it seem like Jonas’s
daddy is a super righteous dude since he got

00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:07.829
an ideal family and all he do is take care of
babies all day. Fool’s job title is even "Nurturer"

00:04:08.530 --> 00:04:11.719
But on the real, there be some shady sh**
goin down under the

00:04:11.720 --> 00:04:16.260
surface. When the Giver show Jonas a video
of his daddy on the grind, he realize that

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:21.160
pops ain’t just about nursin’ babies,
he also kills the ones that ain’t up to snuff.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:22.620
Uh- uhh!

00:04:22.620 --> 00:04:26.340
When Jonas realize how backwards things in
his hood be, he try to

00:04:26.340 --> 00:04:30.670
use dem memories to open up erryone else’s
eyes, but ain’t none of his homies can feel

00:04:30.670 --> 00:04:35.590
him on dat. Like my boy Ivan said in Solzhenitsyn’s
“One Day in the Life of Ivan Denisovich”-

00:04:35.590 --> 00:04:40.510
“How can you expect a man who’s warm to
understand a man who’s cold?”

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:44.570
So in a way, Jonas just like dat
biblical gangsta Jonah, who was sent by the

00:04:44.570 --> 00:04:50.380
big G-man to tell the crooked cats of Nineveh
that they best change their ways. And likewise,

00:04:50.380 --> 00:04:55.100
Jonas gotta spread dat pain and feeling even
though them duds in the hood don’t want him to.

00:04:55.420 --> 00:04:58.460
Look, homies always sayin ignorance is bliss, but is it?

00:04:58.720 --> 00:05:03.760
Well the truth hurts, that's fo damn sure. But on
the real, a playa can’t experience life

00:05:03.760 --> 00:05:07.140
without experiencin pain. Naw mean?

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:19.380
And on the same note, how you gonna know life
without subscribing, man?

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:22.960
Catch me next time playa. Peace.

